1
00:00:00,539 --> 00:00:01,829
[DOOR OPENS THEN CLOSES]

2
00:00:01,999 --> 00:00:05,129
MRS. WOLOWITZ:
Howard, I'm home.

3
00:00:05,294 --> 00:00:07,334
(Howard:)Of course.

4
00:00:07,504 --> 00:00:09,844
MRS. WOLOWITZ:
Senior fitness was canceled.

5
00:00:10,007 --> 00:00:13,217
(Howard's Mother:)It turns out you can forget
how to ride a bike.

6
00:00:14,344 --> 00:00:19,344
(Howard's Mother:)I'm fine, but, oy,
did Sam Harpootian eat gravel.

7
00:00:19,725 --> 00:00:21,395
(Howard:)That's great, Ma.

8
00:00:21,560 --> 00:00:24,100
MRS. WOLOWITZ: What's great
about an 80-year-old Armenian man...

9
00:00:24,271 --> 00:00:26,901
(Howard's Mother:)...with half his chin scraped off?

10
00:00:27,524 --> 00:00:29,484
(Bernadette:)-I guess I should go.
-No, don't move.

11
00:00:29,651 --> 00:00:32,781
(Howard:)Hey, Ma,
can I have lamb stew for dinner?

12
00:00:32,946 --> 00:00:36,656
MRS. WOLOWITZ: Lamb stew?
I'd have to go to the supermarket.

13
00:00:36,825 --> 00:00:40,365
(Howard:)Please? I got a real hankering.

14
00:00:41,955 --> 00:00:47,125
MRS. WOLOWITZ: Oh, I can't say no
to my little tushy-face.

15
00:00:47,419 --> 00:00:50,129
(Howard's Mother:)-I'll be back soon.
-Thanks, Ma.

16
00:00:52,966 --> 00:00:56,306
MRS. WOLOWITZ: Do you want the
regular peas or the Le Sueur?

17
00:00:56,470 --> 00:00:59,310
Always Le Sueur peas
with lamb stew.

